WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.660
Under More: every page, your project, your team, your account.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:08.567
Every project carries its jurisdiction.

00:00:08.567 --> 00:00:12.563
The agencies, the permit program, the notification clocks.

00:00:12.563 --> 00:00:15.870
Set once, and every record you saw already knew.

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.578
Invite a teammate with a link or a QR code.

00:00:19.578 --> 00:00:22.870
Roles set what they can change, never what they can see.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:28.203
Your account is yours. Your name, your sign in methods, your data.

00:00:28.203 --> 00:00:31.530
A firm is a layer on top. The account stays with you.

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:36.445
Every daily log is vaulted before anything replaces it.

00:00:36.445 --> 00:00:39.290
Log Recovery brings a day back in one tap.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:45.250
And the Academy is this video, cut into chapters, one tap away in the app.
